From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] tests: netlogon: fix swapped site names in test_real_packet

netlogon.Decoder.parse() decodes DcSiteName before ClientSiteName, the
order of NETLOGON_SAM_LOGON_RESPONSE_EX in MS-ADTS 2.2.1.9; releases up
to 1.0.5 decoded them the other way round. The test still asserts the
old assignment, so it fails on every platform: tests/protocol/netlogon.bin
carries "Default-First-Site" as the DC site and "Test-Site" as the client
site.

Swap the two expected values to match the decoder and the packet.

Upstream-Status: To upstream [not yet submitted; upstream has no CI running the test suite]

Signed-off-by: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
---
 tests/protocol/test_netlogon.py | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tests/protocol/test_netlogon.py b/tests/protocol/test_netlogon.py
index 711b5f6..519524b 100644
--- a/tests/protocol/test_netlogon.py
+++ b/tests/protocol/test_netlogon.py
@@ -191,8 +191,8 @@ class TestDecoder(object):
         res = dec.parse()
         assert res.forest == b'freeadi.org'
         assert res.domain == b'freeadi.org'
-        assert res.client_site == b'Default-First-Site'
-        assert res.server_site == b'Test-Site'
+        assert res.server_site == b'Default-First-Site'
+        assert res.client_site == b'Test-Site'
 
     def test_error_short_input(self):
         buf = b'x' * 24
